<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- UMW_ZeusHeaded, UMW_PlasmaCored, UMW_Monomolecular, UMW_EltexPlated,
       UMW_EltexFitted and UMW_LeadLined are declared in this
       Royalty compat load root (1.6/Mods/Royalty/Defs/WeaponTraitDefs/) and carry
       no MayRequire of their own. MayRequire is honored on defs but
       IGNORED on DefInjected entries, so these injections live in this
       LoadFolders-gated compat root (1.6/Mods/Royalty loads only when Royalty is
       active) rather than the main
       1.6/Languages/Japanese/DefInjected/WeaponTraitDef/WeaponTraits.xml, which would
       error on startup for players without Royalty. Style conventions for these
       entries are documented in that file's header comment. -->

  <!-- EN: monomolecular -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.label>単分子刃</UMW_Monomolecular.label>

  <!-- EN: The edge is honed to a single molecule and held there by a lattice of mechanites. It parts armor and bone as though they were not there. -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.description>刃は単分子の厚さまで研ぎ上げられ,メカナイトの格子によってその状態が保たれています.装甲も骨も,まるで無いかのように切り分けます.</UMW_Monomolecular.description>

  <!-- EN: mono-edged -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>単分子の</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: crystalline -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>クリスタルの</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: honed -->
  <UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>研ぎ澄まされた</UMW_Monomolecular.traitAdjectives.2>


  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.label>プラズマコア</UMW_PlasmaCored.label>

  <!-- EN: The core of the blade channels a sheath of plasma, held in place by an energy field and released into the wounds it cuts. It sears flesh and sometimes ignites the target. -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.description>刃のコアはプラズマの鞘を導き,エネルギー場によってその場に保持し,切り開いた傷口へと解き放ちます.プラズマは肉を焼き焦がし,ときにはターゲットを発火させます.</UMW_PlasmaCored.description>

  <!-- EN: plasma-cored -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>プラズマの</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: burning -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>燃える</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: searing -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>灼熱の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: fiery -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>火の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.3>

  <!-- EN: incandescent -->
  <UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>白熱の</UMW_PlasmaCored.traitAdjectives.4>


  <!-- EN: zeus-headed -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.label>ゼウスヘッド</UMW_ZeusHeaded.label>

  <!-- EN: The head houses a miniaturized zeus-cell that releases an electromagnetic discharge on impact, temporarily disabling electronics and mechanoids. -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.description>ヘッドには小型化されたゼウスセルが収められており,衝撃を受けると電磁パルスを放出して,電子機器とメカノイドを一時的に機能停止させます.</UMW_ZeusHeaded.description>

  <!-- EN: zeus-headed -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.0>ゼウスの</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: thunderous -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.1>雷鳴の</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: electric -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.2>電気の</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: shocking -->
  <UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.3>感電の</UMW_ZeusHeaded.traitAdjectives.3>

  <!-- EN: eltex-plated -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.label>エルテックスプレート</UMW_EltexPlated.label>

  <!-- EN: The body is plated in eltex, a psychically resonant alloy, under a pale sheen. It sharpens the wielder's psychic sensitivity and bleeds away neural heat. -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.description>本体は淡い光沢の下で,サイキックに共鳴する合金エルテックスによって覆われています.使用者の精神感応性を研ぎ澄まし,ニューラルヒートを放散させます.</UMW_EltexPlated.description>

  <!-- EN: eltex-plated -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.0>エルテックス張りの</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: pale-sheened -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.1>淡い光沢の</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.2>共鳴する</UMW_EltexPlated.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: eltex-fitted -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.label>エルテックス金具</UMW_EltexFitted.label>

  <!-- EN: The grip, guard and pommel are fitted in eltex, cut dark and left unpolished. It widens the wielder's neural heat limit and amplifies their psychic sensitivity. -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.description>グリップ,ガード,柄頭にはエルテックスが取り付けられ,暗い色に削り出されたまま磨かれていません.使用者のニューラルヒートの限界を広げ,精神感応性を増幅します.</UMW_EltexFitted.description>

  <!-- EN: eltex-fitted -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.0>エルテックス金具の</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: eltex-furnished -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.1>エルテックスをあしらった</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: resonant -->
  <UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.2>共鳴する</UMW_EltexFitted.traitAdjectives.2>

  <!-- EN: lead-lined -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.label>鉛張り</UMW_LeadLined.label>

  <!-- EN: The tang and fittings are lined with lead, which deadens the wielder's psychic sensitivity for better and for worse. The lining adds weight and slows the swing. -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.description>茎と金具には鉛が張られており,使用者の精神感応性を鈍らせます.それが利点にも欠点にもなります.張られた鉛は重量を増やし,振りを遅くします.</UMW_LeadLined.description>

  <!-- EN: lead-lined -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.0>鉛張りの</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.0>

  <!-- EN: leaden -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.1>鉛の</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.1>

  <!-- EN: deadened -->
  <UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.2>鈍った</UMW_LeadLined.traitAdjectives.2>

</LanguageData>
